.TH SDE-RUN 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-run \- run command dialog
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-run
[\-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-run\fR asks for a command and starts it without a shell (Alt+F2).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop/issues
